007, mol_001 (Direct Strecker synthesis of aminoacetonitrile from formaldehyde) [Surface]\n  - rxn_002: mol_004, mol_003 -> mol_005, mol_001 (Methanimine formation from formaldehyde and ammonia) [Surface]\n  - rxn_003: mol_005, mol_002 -> mol_007 (Cyanide addition to methanimine) [Surface]\n  - rxn_004: mol_004, mol_002 -> mol_006 (Cyanohydrin formation: glycolonitrile from formaldehyde and hydrogen cyanide) [Surface]\n  - rxn_005: mol_006, mol_003 -> mol_007, mol_001 (Ammonia-driven conversion of glycolonitrile to aminoacetonitrile) [Surface]\n  - rxn_006: mol_007, mol_001 -> mol_008 (Aminoacetonitrile hydration to glycinamide) [Biochemical]\n  - rxn_007: mol_008, mol_001 -> mol_009, mol_003 (Glycinamide hydrolysis to glycine) [Biochemical]\n  - rxn_008: mol_007, mol_001 -> mol_009, mol_003 (Overall hydrothermal hydrolysis of aminoacetonitrile to glycine) [Hydrothermal]\n  - rxn_009: mol_004, mol_002, mol_003, mol_010 -> mol_011, mol_001 (Bucherer-Bergs-like hydantoin formation from formaldehyde) [Surface]\n  - rxn_010: mol_008, mol_010 -> mol_011, mol_001 (Carboxylative cyclization of glycinamide to hydantoin) [Surface]\n  - rxn_011: mol_011, mol_001 -> mol_009, mol_003, mol_010 (Hydrothermal hydrolysis of hydantoin to glycine) [Hydrothermal]\n\nPATHWAYS (10):\n  - P1: Direct Strecker then hydrothermal hydrolysis (2 steps)\n  - P2: Direct Strecker then stepwise amide hydrolysis (3 steps)\n  - P3: Imine-resolved Strecker then hydrothermal hydrolysis (3 steps)\n  - P4: Imine-resolved Strecker then stepwise amide hydrolysis (4 steps)\n  - P5: Cyanohydrin-ammonia route then hydrothermal hydrolysis (3 steps)\n  - P6: Cyanohydrin-ammonia route then stepwise amide hydrolysis (4 steps)\n  - P7: Direct Bucherer-Bergs-like hydantoin route (2 steps)\n  - P8: Direct Strecker to glycinamide then hydantoin detour (4 steps)\n  - P9: Imine-resolved Strecker to glycinamide then hydantoin detour (5 steps)\n  - P10: Cyanohydrin-ammonia to glycinamide then hydantoin detour (5 steps)\